  "agent_notes": [
    "The NIRF Engineering, Management, and Overall 2025 official listings each contain Bundelkhand Institute of Engineering & Technology, JHANSI, Uttar Pradesh.",
    "The official site is verified at bietjhs.ac.in. Normal TLS produced the exact managed-proxy self-signed-certificate-in-chain error; public GET requests then used curl --insecure only for the expected official hosts.",
    "The official catalogue is partial and internally inconsistent. The academic masters page lists seven M.Tech courses, including Biomedical Engineering and Energy Science and Technology, while the current 05 August 2026 M.Tech admission notice lists five active specializations and the admissions page lists only four. The current notice was used for current M.Tech rows; Biomedical Engineering and Energy Science and Technology were not asserted as current.",
    "The official MBA pages disagree on the fourth dual-specialization option: the academic page lists Information Technology, while the admissions page lists International Business. The MBA degree family is included without asserting a specialization.",
    "The official B.Tech catalogue consistently lists seven branches: Chemical Engineering, Civil Engineering, Computer Science & Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Electronics & Communication Engineering, Information Technology, and Mechanical Engineering.",
    "The current official M.Tech notice is an image-only PDF; programme names were read from its official rendered page after command-line download."
  ]
